[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 1. Calculate the total number of eggs laid per day.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 2. Determine how many eggs are eaten for breakfast.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 3. Determine how many eggs are used to bake muffins.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 4. Calculate the number of eggs left for sale at the farmers' market.
