[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    E(S) = E(X) + E(Y)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    Since \( E(X) = 4.5 \) and \( E(Y) = 4.5 \), we have:
