[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 2. \( 8 + x > 8 \)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 3. \( 8 + x > 8 \)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m Simplifying these inequalities, we get:
