[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m Next, we square the expression $\cos \theta - \sin \theta$ to find a relationship that can help us solve for it. Let $x = \cos \theta - \sin \theta$. Then:
