[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m ### Step 1: Calculate the Expected Value of a Single Die
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m Each die has faces numbered from 1 to 8. The expected value \(E\) of a single die roll can be calculated as follows:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \[ E = \frac{1 + 2 + 3 + 4 + 5 + 6 + 7 + 8}{8} \]
