[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 3. **Analyze the intersection of the altitudes:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    - In an isosceles triangle, the altitudes from the two equal sides intersect at the vertex angle bisector.
