[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 4. **Determine the cosine of the vertex angle:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    - Let the vertex angle be \(2\theta\). Since the altitudes intersect on the incircle, the vertex angle bisector is also the angle bisector of the vertex angle.
