[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m So, the velocity vector is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \left( \frac{3}{4} \cos \frac{t}{4}, -\frac{3}{4} \sin \frac{t}{4} \right)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m Next, we find the speed of the particle, which is the magnitude of the velocity vector:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \text{Speed} = \sqrt{\left( \frac{3}{4} \cos \frac{t}{4} \right)^2 + \left( -\frac{3}{4} \sin \frac{t}{4} \right)^2}
