[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 1. Today's height: 452 cm
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 2. Since the height increases by 5% each day, we can express today's height as:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    \text{Today's height} = \text{Height 2 weeks ago} \times (1 + 0.05)^{2 \times 7}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    \]
