[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 4. Calculate \( (1.05)^{14} \):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    \[
