[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 5. Now, solve for the height 2 weeks ago:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    \text{Height 2 weeks ago} = \frac{452}{2.01135} \approx 225.0
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
