[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 3. **Altitudes and Incircle:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    - The altitudes of an isosceles triangle are also the angle bisectors of the vertex angles.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    - The altitudes intersect at the orthocenter of the triangle.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    - The incircle is the circle that is tangent to all three sides of the triangle.
