[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m For the baseball:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m - Mass (\( m_{\text{baseball}} \)) = 150 g = 0.15 kg
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m - Acceleration (\( a_{\text{baseball}} \)) = \( \frac{F}{0.15} \)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
