[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 1. **Identify the total number of possible outcomes when rolling two dice:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    Each die has 6 faces, so the total number of outcomes when rolling two dice is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    6 \times 6 = 36
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 2. **Determine the favorable outcomes where the difference between the two numbers is 0:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    The only way the difference between the two numbers is 0 is if both dice show the same number. The possible outcomes are:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    - (1, 1)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    - (2, 2)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    - (3, 3)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m    - (4, 4)
