[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m Now, we use the Law of Cosines to find \(\cos B\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \[\cos B = \frac{a^2 + c^2 - b^2}{2ac}.\]
