[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m Step 2:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m Calculate the revenue from the flash sale:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m Sneakers sold at flash sale = 17
