[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \[ F = m \cdot a \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m where \( F \) is the force, \( m \) is the mass, and \( a \) is the acceleration.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m Jen wants to throw a softball with the same force as Jack throws a baseball. Let's denote the force as \( F \), the mass of the softball as \( m_s = 200 \) g, and the mass of the baseball as \( m_b = 150 \) g. The acceleration of the softball is \( a_s \) and the acceleration of the baseball is \( a_b \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
