[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \[ F = m_b \cdot a_b \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m We can set these two equations equal to each other since they both equal \( F \):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
