[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m Substituting the given masses:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \[ 200 \cdot a_s = 150 \cdot a_b \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m To find the ratio of the acceleration of Jen's ball to Jack's, we solve for \( \frac{a_s}{a_b} \):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
