[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m So, the value of \(\frac{2x + y}{3x - 2y}\) is \(\boxed{10}\).
