[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m - The mass of the baseball, \( m_{\text{baseball}} = 150 \) g
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m - The force is the same for both objects, so \( F \) is the same for both.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m We can set up the equation for the softball and the baseball as follows:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \[ F = m_{\text{softball}} \cdot a_{\text{softball}} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \[ F = m_{\text{baseball}} \cdot a_{\text{baseball}} \]
