[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m To find the ratio of the acceleration of Jen's ball to Jack's, we solve for \( \frac{a_{\text{softball}}}{a_{\text{baseball}}} \):
