[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \frac{d}{dt} \left( 3 \cos \frac{t}{4} \right) = 3 \cdot \left( -\frac{1}{4} \right) \sin \frac{t}{4} = -\frac{3}{4} \sin \frac{t}{4}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \]
