[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m This matches \(-\frac{7}{4}\), so the sum of the roots is correct.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m The product of the roots is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \left(\frac{-7 + i\sqrt{15}}{8}\right) \left(\frac{-7 - i\sqrt{15}}{8}\right) = \frac{(-7)^2 - (i\sqrt{15})^2}{64} = \frac{49 + 15}{64} = \frac{64}{64} = 1
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m This matches \(\frac{k}{4}\), so we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \frac{k}{4} = 1 \implies k = 4
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m Thus, the value of \(k\) is \(\boxed{4}\).
