[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \[2a^2 + 4b^2 + c^2 - 4ab - 2ac = 0.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m We can rewrite this equation by completing the square:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \[2a^2 - 4ab + 4b^2 + c^2 - 2ac = 0,\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \[2(a^2 - 2ab + b^2) + c^2 - 2ac = 0,\]
