[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \[x^2 + x - 6 = (x + 3)(x - 2).\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m Setting the denominator equal to zero gives us:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \[(x + 3)(x - 2) = 0.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m So, the solutions are:
