[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m Find the matrix that corresponds to projecting onto the vector $\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 7 \end{pmatrix}.$ Let's think step by step and output the final answer within \boxed{}.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m assistant
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m [response] To find the matrix that corresponds to projecting any vector onto the vector \(\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 7 \end{pmatrix}\), we use the formula for the projection matrix \(P\) onto a vector \(\mathbf{a} = \begin{pmatrix} a_1 \\ a_2 \end{pmatrix}\), which is given by:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \[ P = \frac{\mathbf{a} \mathbf{a}^T}{\mathbf{a}^T \mathbf{a}} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m Here, \(\mathbf{a} = \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 7 \end{pmatrix}\). First, we compute \(\mathbf{a} \mathbf{a}^T\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \[ \mathbf{a} \mathbf{a}^T = \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 7 \end{pmatrix} \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 7 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 7 \\ 7 & 49 \end{pmatrix} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m Next, we compute \(\mathbf{a}^T \mathbf{a}\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \[ \mathbf{a}^T \mathbf{a} = 1^2 + 7^2 = 1 + 49 = 50 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m Now, we can find the projection matrix \(P\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \[ P = \frac{1}{50} \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 7 \\ 7 & 49 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} \frac{1}{50} & \frac{7}{50} \\ \frac{7}{50} & \frac{49}{50} \end{pmatrix} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m Thus, the matrix that corresponds to projecting onto the vector \(\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 7 \end{pmatrix}\) is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \boxed{\begin{pmatrix} \frac{1}{50} & \frac{7}{50} \\ \frac{7}{50} & \frac{49}{50} \end{pmatrix}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=55750)[0m [ground_truth] \begin{pmatrix} 1/50 & 7/50 \\ 7/50 & 49/50 \end{pmatrix}
